From 2ceca0f7ae387928f3d59a15318722ecda6eb213 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:17:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] custom_io: import the two custom pad cells into
 magic/custom_io

New scripts/setup_custom_io.sh (companion of setup.sh) copies nothing from
the PDK; it uniquifies the sub-cell names of the committed pad GDS with
scripts/custom_io_uniquify.py (prefix cm_d2s_ / cm_s2d_), reads the result
with gds readonly / rescale false like the foundry library, and sets
FIXED_BBOX 0 0 80 180 um.  magic/custom_io/ is tracked (not .gitignore'd),
with PROVENANCE.md.  scripts/layout_setup.tcl gets 'addpath custom_io'.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XU3KH5LbmFCchnNvtB8nAZ
